# Reefmachine Atoll (CIPlay reefmachine_atoll): the lagoon floor at -5 m (round 0 0); the frame rows, the frame plate,
# the rays, the sunk boat, the puffers, the pump head's air, its chest, the frame valve (twice), the service note, the cage.
island Reefmachine Atoll
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Intake
zone frame_row
expect step 1
read Frame plate
expect step 2
kill Stingray
expect animals Stingray 0
expect step 3
open Service boat
wait 3
expect step 4
kill Puffer fish
air pump_head
expect step 6
open Pump head
wait 3
expect step 7
expect shown cagegate
use framevalve
expect story valve 1
expect hidden cagegate
use framevalve
expect story valve 1
expect step 8
read Service note
expect step 9
use sluicecrank
expect message socket is empty
open Supply plane's crate
wait 3
expect story reefhandle 1
expect step 10
read Pump keeper's diary
expect step 11
use sluicecrank
expect shown sluicecrate
open Sluice crate
wait 3
expect story raft-Vasagatan_BoltCutter 1
expect step 12
# (deep pass 10-24: the top locker refuses, the dive, the air bell, the dive chest, the buried tins, the tower)
open Frame tower locker
expect message A dial lock
zone ra_dive
expect step 13
air ra_air
open Drowned supply van
wait 3
expect story reeflog 1
expect step 14
open Van glovebox
wait 3
dig 3
climb -49.76 -37.56
open Frame tower stash
wait 3
read Reef cairn
dig 2
zone ra_top
open Frame tower locker
wait 3
expect story chainkey 1
zone cage
expect done
